{"seq":1,"slug":"fzf-advanced-patterns","title":"fzf 高级模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/modern-cli-ecosystem/navigation-and-search/fzf-advanced-patterns","wordCount":623,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"fzf-高级模式\">fzf 高级模式</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>fzf 是命令行世界的「万能连接器」。它不搜索文件内容、不记忆目录、不管理 Git——它只做一件事：接收文本行输入，提供交互式模糊搜索界面，返回用户选择的结果。正是这种极致的「只做一件事」设计，让 fzf 能接入任何产出文本的命令，成为整个终端工具生态的 UI 层。截至 2026 年 5 月，fzf 最新版本为 0.72.0，GitHub 星数超过 68k。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"fzf-的数据流模型\">fzf 的数据流模型</h3><p>fzf 遵循严格的 Unix 工具哲学：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;data source: stdin&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;fzf: interactive filter&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;selected item: stdout&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;fd / rg / git / ps&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;vim / cd / kill / xargs&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"data source: stdin\"] --&gt; B[\"fzf: interactive filter\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"selected item: stdout\"]\n    D[\"fd / rg / git / ps\"] --&gt; A\n    C --&gt; E[\"vim / cd / kill / xargs\"]</pre><p>三个阶段各自独立：数据源可以是任何命令；fzf 提供交互式筛选 UI；输出可以传给任何下游命令。这种解耦设计让 fzf 的应用场景无限延展。</p>\n<h3 id=\"匹配算法\">匹配算法</h3><p>fzf 提供两种匹配模式：</p>\n<p>| 模式             | 语法   | 行为                            |\n| ---------------- | ------ | ------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| 模糊匹配（默认） | <code>abc</code>  | 匹配包含 a、b、c 且顺序正确的行 |\n| 精确匹配         | <code>&#39;abc</code> | 只匹配包含连续 &quot;abc&quot; 的行       |\n| 前缀匹配         | <code>^abc</code> | 行必须以 &quot;abc&quot; 开头             |\n| 后缀匹配         | <code>abc$</code> | 行必须以 &quot;abc&quot; 结尾             |\n| 取反             | <code>!abc</code> | 排除包含 &quot;abc&quot; 的行             |\n| OR               | <code>abc   | def</code>                            | 匹配 abc 或 def |</p>\n<p>这些可以组合使用：<code>^src .ts$ !test</code> 表示「以 src 开头、以 .ts 结尾、不含 test」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"shell-集成-核心三键绑定\">Shell 集成（核心三键绑定）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# ~/.zshrc — fzf 0.48+ 简化配置&#10;source &lt;(fzf --zsh)&#10;&#10;# Ctrl+R: 模糊搜索命令历史（替代内建 reverse-i-search）&#10;# Ctrl+T: 模糊搜索文件并粘贴路径到命令行&#10;# Alt+C:  模糊搜索目录并 cd 进入\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.zshrc — fzf 0.48+ 简化配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --zsh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Ctrl+R: 模糊搜索命令历史（替代内建 reverse-i-search）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Ctrl+T: 模糊搜索文件并粘贴路径到命令行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Alt+C:  模糊搜索目录并 cd 进入</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"预览窗口深度配置\">预览窗口深度配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 基础文件预览（用 bat 提供语法高亮）&#10;fzf --preview &#39;bat --color=always --line-range :100 {}&#39;&#10;&#10;# 预览窗口位置和大小&#10;fzf --preview &#39;bat --color=always {}&#39; --preview-window right:60%:wrap&#10;&#10;# 动态预览：根据文件类型切换&#10;fzf --preview &#39;&#10;  if [ -d {} ]; then&#10;    eza --tree --level=2 --icons --color=always {}&#10;  elif [ -f {} ]; then&#10;    bat --color=always --line-range :80 {}&#10;  else&#10;    echo &quot;Special: {}&quot;&#10;  fi&#10;&#39;&#10;&#10;# 预览窗口控制键绑定&#10;fzf --preview &#39;bat --color=always {}&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-/:toggle-preview&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-u:preview-half-page-up&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-d:preview-half-page-down&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基础文件预览（用 bat 提供语法高亮）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bat --color=always --line-range :100 {}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 预览窗口位置和大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bat --color=always {}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview-window</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> right:60%:wrap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 动态预览：根据文件类型切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  if [ -d {} ]; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    eza --tree --level=2 --icons --color=always {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  elif [ -f {} ]; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    bat --color=always --line-range :80 {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"Special: {}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 预览窗口控制键绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bat --color=always {}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-/:toggle-preview'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-u:preview-half-page-up'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-d:preview-half-page-down'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义键绑定与动作\">自定义键绑定与动作</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在 fzf 内执行动作（不退出）&#10;fzf --bind &#39;ctrl-e:execute(vim {} &lt; /dev/tty &gt; /dev/tty)&#39;&#10;fzf --bind &#39;ctrl-y:execute-silent(echo {} | pbcopy)&#39;&#10;&#10;# 改变预览内容&#10;fzf --preview &#39;bat --color=always {}&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-g:change-preview(git log --oneline -20 {})&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-b:change-preview(bat --color=always {})&#39;&#10;&#10;# accept 动作（选中并退出）&#10;fzf --bind &#39;ctrl-o:accept&#39;&#10;&#10;# 多选操作&#10;fzf --multi \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-a:select-all&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-d:deselect-all&#39; \\&#10;    --bind &#39;ctrl-t:toggle-all&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 fzf 内执行动作（不退出）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-e:execute(vim {} &#x3C; /dev/tty > /dev/tty)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-y:execute-silent(echo {} | pbcopy)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 改变预览内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preview</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bat --color=always {}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-g:change-preview(git log --oneline -20 {})'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-b:change-preview(bat --color=always {})'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># accept 动作（选中并退出）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-o:accept'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 多选操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --multi</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-a:select-all'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-d:deselect-all'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ctrl-t:toggle-all'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"动态重载-reload-pattern\">动态重载（Reload Pattern）</h3><p>这是 fzf 最强大的高级模式——每次按键都重新执行数据源命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 实时 ripgrep 搜索（每个字符触发 rg 重新搜索）&#10;RG_PREFIX=&quot;rg --column --line-number --no-heading --color=always --smart-case&quot;&#10;fzf --ansi --disabled \\&#10;    --bind &quot;start:reload:$RG_PREFIX {q}&quot; \\&#10;    --bind &quot;change:reload:sleep 0.1; $RG_PREFIX {q} || true&quot; \\&#10;    --delimiter : \\&#10;    --preview &#39;bat --color=always {1} --highlight-line {2}&#39; \\&#10;    --preview-window &#39;up,60%,border-bottom,+{2}+3/3,~3&#39;&#10;&#10;# 在 fzf 模糊和 rg 精确搜索之间切换&#10;fzf --ansi --disabled \\&#10;    --bind &quot;start:reload:$RG_PREFIX &#39;&#39;&quot; \\&#10;    --bind &quot;change:reload:$RG_PREFIX {q} || true&quot; \\&#10;    --bind &quot;ctrl-f:unbind(change)+clear-query+enable-search&quot; \\&#10;    --bind &quot;ctrl-r:rebind(change)+disable-search+clear-query&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实时 ripgrep 搜索（每个字符触发 rg 重新搜索）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RG_PREFIX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rg --column --line-number --no-heading --color=always --smart-case\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fzf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ansi</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --disabled</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"start:reload:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$RG_PREFIX</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {q}\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"change:reload:sleep 0.1; </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$RG_PREFIX</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {q} || true\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --delimiter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#7